WEBVTT

00:04.410 --> 00:06.110
I don't see it...

00:06.440 --> 00:08.350
Sorry about this, Ishikawa-kun.

00:08.350 --> 00:10.080
Nah, don't sweat it.

00:10.080 --> 00:11.650
You dropped it around here, right?

00:11.650 --> 00:12.740
Yes.

00:12.740 --> 00:14.700
I just wish I could help you look...

00:12.740 --> 00:17.740
<b>Wobble Wobble Wobble</b>

00:14.700 --> 00:17.740
Don't worry! Just stay there where it's safe!

00:18.170 --> 00:21.920
You bought some glasses, broke them, 
and now you've dropped your contact...

00:21.920 --> 00:24.080
You should eat more blueberries.

00:24.080 --> 00:25.230
Yeah.

00:25.230 --> 00:28.120
If it doesn't turn up, don't worry about it.

00:28.120 --> 00:29.250
You must be getting cold.

00:29.690 --> 00:32.270
We gotta help each other when we need it.

00:33.760 --> 00:35.100
<i>{int}He's kneeling?!</i>

00:33.760 --> 00:35.630
<b>Kneeling...?!</b>

00:36.040 --> 00:37.910
<i>{int}What the heck is happening here?</i>

00:37.910 --> 00:41.160
<i>{int}Did Yanagi-kun do something to Ishikawa-kun?</i>

00:43.190 --> 00:46.240
<i>{int}I need to tell them that 
it's time to go home.</i>

00:46.240 --> 00:49.650
<i>{int}And then... ask what's going on.</i>

00:51.400 --> 00:53.400
<i><b>He's glaring...</b></i>

00:53.400 --> 00:56.660
<b>RUMMMBLE</b>

00:56.660 --> 00:58.410
Found it!

00:59.520 --> 01:00.730
Thank you!

01:00.730 --> 01:02.790
Just don't drop it again!

01:02.790 --> 01:05.040
Hey, was someone there a second ago?

01:05.040 --> 01:08.510
I think so, but I couldn't really tell.

01:08.510 --> 01:10.400
Whoever it was ran away.

01:11.550 --> 01:13.490
That's weird.

01:11.550 --> 01:14.050
<b>Student Council</b>

01:17.370 --> 01:20.970
Sengoku-kun, did you make sure 
everything's locked up?

01:20.970 --> 01:25.170
<i>{int}I'm sorry, Father. I couldn't make 
the first move against Yanagi-kun.</i>

01:25.170 --> 01:26.600
Sengoku-kun?

02:58.900 --> 03:02.400
Yanagi-kun missed our elective class today.

03:02.400 --> 03:03.690
Did he?

03:02.660 --> 03:08.540
<b>Yanagi-kun</b>

03:04.400 --> 03:07.120
It's my only chance with him during the day.

03:07.120 --> 03:08.540
Chance for what?

03:08.540 --> 03:12.100
Come to think of it, he's absent 
for a lot of morning classes.

03:12.490 --> 03:14.340
Maybe he has trouble waking up.

03:14.340 --> 03:15.770
Maybe.

03:18.030 --> 03:19.200
Akane!

03:20.370 --> 03:21.400
See you tomorrow!

03:21.400 --> 03:22.300
Right!

03:23.750 --> 03:27.070
Hori-san, now's your daily Yanagi-kun chance.

03:28.980 --> 03:30.110
Hori-san?

03:30.110 --> 03:31.740
Why...

03:31.740 --> 03:32.440
Huh?

03:32.440 --> 03:35.420
Why are you calling Yanagi-kun 
by his first name?!

03:35.420 --> 03:36.820
Um, I...

03:36.820 --> 03:37.830
I'm sorry!

03:38.320 --> 03:39.990
Like you're the best of friends...

03:39.990 --> 03:45.070
I mean, I call him by his first name,
but it doesn't mean anything...

03:45.070 --> 03:47.790
I want to call him by his first name, too!

03:47.790 --> 03:49.080
Wait, <i>that's</i> what this is?

03:49.430 --> 03:53.010
Do you think Yanagi-kun would mind 
if I asked to call him by his first name?

03:53.010 --> 03:54.770
I doubt it.

03:54.770 --> 03:56.710
Y-You think so?

03:57.350 --> 03:58.580
Really?

03:59.710 --> 04:01.320
Weirdo.

04:01.320 --> 04:03.810
Don't be like that. I'm just happy.

04:04.410 --> 04:06.850
Kyon-Kyon, have you seen Yanagin?

04:07.240 --> 04:08.580
He just left.

04:08.580 --> 04:09.700
What?

04:09.700 --> 04:12.460
But I brought these cookies for him...

04:16.390 --> 04:17.860
Want them, Kyon-Kyon?

04:18.970 --> 04:20.860
Sorry, I'm full.

04:20.860 --> 04:23.850
That's too bad. Sakura made them.

04:24.860 --> 04:25.970
Really?!

04:25.970 --> 04:27.010
So what if she did?

04:27.010 --> 04:27.790
Gimme!

04:27.790 --> 04:28.430
No way.

04:28.430 --> 04:31.500
{bg}Come on! Just a few!

04:29.140 --> 04:31.500
{bg}This sucks.

04:31.500 --> 04:33.820
The bus is running super late.

04:33.820 --> 04:36.670
And I'm super in a hurry. It super sucks.

04:36.670 --> 04:39.240
Super same. For real.

04:39.240 --> 04:40.500
What's wrong, Miyamura?

04:40.500 --> 04:44.430
Sounds like the bus is super,
super, super, super, super late.

04:44.430 --> 04:45.510
<i>That</i> late?

04:45.890 --> 04:48.510
I think Akane commutes by bus.

04:49.080 --> 04:51.520
And it's really windy today.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.680
<i>{int}The bus hasn't come yet.</i>

05:01.750 --> 05:03.020
<i>It's cold.</i>

05:03.530 --> 05:06.040
Yo there, you all by your lonesome?

05:08.530 --> 05:10.280
<b>Bus Stop








Katagiri High School</b>

05:08.530 --> 05:11.160
Oh, erm, did you mean me?

05:14.440 --> 05:15.720
Ayasaki-san?

05:15.720 --> 05:17.470
Nope, I'm not Remi.

05:17.470 --> 05:19.040
What are you doing?

05:19.040 --> 05:20.030
Hitting on you.

05:20.030 --> 05:21.170
Hitting on me?!

05:21.740 --> 05:24.220
Gotta say, you're a cute one.

05:24.220 --> 05:26.650
If you're down, wanna hang with me?

05:26.650 --> 05:27.830
<i>{int}Should I?</i>

05:28.430 --> 05:30.180
<i>{int}Is she playing some kind of game?</i>

05:30.180 --> 05:33.310
Hey, back off. You're 
bothering the poor thing.

05:33.310 --> 05:35.950
You should know when you're not wanted.

05:35.950 --> 05:36.720
Hori-san?

05:36.720 --> 05:39.810
No, I'm just someone who, uh...

05:40.470 --> 05:42.080
Someone passing by.

05:42.080 --> 05:46.580
Oh, so you're not solo. 
That's it. I'm outta here.

05:46.580 --> 05:48.400
That's enough out of you, lowlife.

05:47.560 --> 05:48.400
You—

05:48.400 --> 05:49.840
Oh, sorry, you go ahead.

05:49.840 --> 05:50.820
You sure?

05:50.820 --> 05:52.580
Sorry, I, uh...

05:54.840 --> 05:57.680
We forgot the next line, 
so we're skipping it.

05:57.680 --> 05:59.080
I see.

05:59.080 --> 06:04.090
Hey, I heard at school that the bus 
is gonna be fifteen minutes late.

06:04.090 --> 06:06.230
Oh, really?

06:06.230 --> 06:07.340
You got it.

06:07.340 --> 06:09.840
And it's a cold one today.

06:10.250 --> 06:11.770
<i>So they came to let me know.</i>

06:12.140 --> 06:16.570
Thank you. If it's just fifteen 
minutes, I can wait it out.

06:16.570 --> 06:17.550
Heya.

06:18.960 --> 06:20.240
I got 'em!

06:20.240 --> 06:21.930
What took you?

06:21.930 --> 06:23.770
Want some hot cocoa, Yanagin?

06:23.770 --> 06:24.570
Huh?

06:25.480 --> 06:26.170
Here.

06:29.910 --> 06:32.080
Hey, they're all hot cocoa!

06:32.080 --> 06:34.840
I figured no one would fight
if it was all the same.

06:34.840 --> 06:36.750
Say, did you get one for me?

06:36.750 --> 06:40.200
Y...a... Y...a... Yanagi-kun, 
we brought cookies, too.

06:40.200 --> 06:41.890
<i>{int}"Y...a... Y...a..."?</i>

06:41.890 --> 06:43.270
Thank you.

06:43.270 --> 06:46.290
{bg}It's so warm! Thank you!

06:43.710 --> 06:46.290
Kono-san made them. They're really good.

06:46.290 --> 06:48.270
{bg}It's freezing today.

06:46.290 --> 06:49.510
Thank you. Um, I...

06:48.270 --> 06:51.270
{bg}Miyamura-kun, do you like hot cocoa?

06:49.910 --> 06:52.510
No one likes waiting in the cold all alone.

06:51.270 --> 06:53.050
{bg}It feels really good in winter.

06:52.510 --> 06:54.160
Am I right?

06:53.050 --> 06:54.160
{bg}I know, right?

06:56.520 --> 06:58.260
O-Or are we bothering you?

06:58.260 --> 06:59.940
We can head back to school—

06:59.940 --> 07:01.530
No, not at all!

07:03.780 --> 07:04.600
A text?

07:04.600 --> 07:05.640
From my dad.

07:05.640 --> 07:11.190
He was excited about coming home 
early so we could all go out to eat.

07:09.780 --> 07:12.030
Dad

07:09.780 --> 07:12.030
Should I come get you?

07:13.310 --> 07:15.780
You know, Yanagin...

07:16.120 --> 07:20.850
It was Miyamura-kun's idea 
to get you something warm to drink.

07:20.850 --> 07:23.980
Ayasaki-san, where did you 
get those sunglasses?

07:23.980 --> 07:25.450
The student council room.

07:25.450 --> 07:26.630
Whose are they?!

07:26.630 --> 07:30.550
Oh, sorry! I ate five cookies by myself!

07:31.420 --> 07:33.470
I should've brought my coat today.

07:33.470 --> 07:34.890
Me, too.

07:34.890 --> 07:37.590
You girls must already be cold
with your legs exposed.

07:35.800 --> 07:39.060
No need. I'm with my friends

07:37.590 --> 07:39.070
You could try a skirt, Miyamura.

07:39.070 --> 07:40.030
Why?!

07:42.280 --> 07:44.810
Hori-san, I'd like a cookie, please.

07:44.810 --> 07:45.950
Here!

07:45.950 --> 07:47.380
Thank you.

07:49.480 --> 07:52.820
I've heard that certain students 
have been skipping elective classes

07:52.820 --> 07:55.820
because they're frequently self-study hall.

07:55.820 --> 07:57.550
This is an important time of year.

07:57.550 --> 08:00.830
You must use the remainder of it wisely!

08:00.830 --> 08:01.830
Therefore...

08:01.830 --> 08:06.640
I will not permit any tardiness among
the students of class 3-6 next week!

08:06.640 --> 08:07.460
Understood?!

08:07.460 --> 08:09.640
Yes, ma'am.

08:13.740 --> 08:18.220
When Sengoku sends a text,
sometimes I wonder if it's really him.

08:18.220 --> 08:19.300
I get that.

08:19.300 --> 08:21.710
Why?! I send perfectly normal texts!

08:20.470 --> 08:22.980
Yuki wants to go to the zoo
Invite Ayasaki-san and Kouno-san along






{Quoted}<From Sengoku>
Tomorrow? Sure, I'm free. Why?

08:22.250 --> 08:23.240
At first, sure.

08:22.980 --> 08:24.980
Use kanji in your texts. 
Okay. I think they'll go, too.

08:23.240 --> 08:25.590
They start off perfectly normal.

08:24.980 --> 08:27.230
I'll do what I want

You should try some cute faces in yours

08:27.230 --> 08:29.230
Kyo-chan, I saw some water backflowing
all over the floor at school today—
Waa~ How stupid~

08:29.580 --> 08:31.780
Do you feel no shame when texting?

08:31.780 --> 08:33.740
Please stop going through those texts...

08:33.740 --> 08:38.350
To be fair, sometimes when Miyamura 
texts me, I feel like I'm talking to a girl.

08:38.350 --> 08:40.120
You do?

08:40.500 --> 08:42.370
What do you think, Yanagi?

08:40.740 --> 08:41.120
<i><b>THUD</b></i>

08:45.230 --> 08:48.930
Yanagi, did you just
 hit your head on the desk?

08:48.930 --> 08:50.930
Huh? What makes you think that?

08:50.930 --> 08:53.630
Why would I hit my head on the desk?

08:54.140 --> 08:56.130
<i>{int}He looks bleary-eyed.</i>

08:56.130 --> 08:58.750
Yanagi-kun, are you tired?

08:58.750 --> 09:00.740
Did you sleep okay? Is something wrong?

09:00.740 --> 09:04.390
Um, well... actually...

09:07.400 --> 09:09.660
You can't be late for a week?

09:09.660 --> 09:11.800
Like an anti-tardiness campaign?

09:11.800 --> 09:13.820
That makes it sound like a good thing.

09:13.820 --> 09:14.780
No, it doesn't.

09:14.780 --> 09:18.660
I have trouble getting up, and I get 
so nervous that I can't fall asleep.

09:18.660 --> 09:23.240
Even one tardiness will get my name
and photo put up for everyone to see.

09:20.780 --> 09:24.910
<i><b>Terror...</b></i>

09:23.240 --> 09:24.910
<i>{int}Th-That's going too far.</i>

09:24.910 --> 09:27.420
<i>{int}Yanagi-kun is tardy a lot.</i>

09:27.420 --> 09:28.490
What if you go to bed early?

09:28.490 --> 09:32.670
I tried, but I wake up at odd hours.

09:32.670 --> 09:34.800
That's a vicious cycle.

09:34.800 --> 09:37.900
But it's only for two more days,
 so I'll tough it out.

09:37.900 --> 09:40.670
Okay, but make sure you set your alarm clock.

09:40.670 --> 09:45.060
Yeah, I've actually been setting two of them.

09:45.060 --> 09:48.570
Oh, but one stopped yesterday,

09:48.570 --> 09:51.120
so I barely made it on time today.

09:51.120 --> 09:52.070
It just stopped?

09:52.070 --> 09:56.840
No, I found it broken on the floor
across the room from my bed.

09:58.070 --> 10:00.690
I don't remember moving it, though.

10:00.690 --> 10:03.480
I discovered it when I got home.

10:05.800 --> 10:11.110
My bed was a mess, too, but my parents 
said they hadn't been in my room.

10:11.110 --> 10:14.840
It's a little mysterious... and kinda freaky.

10:16.240 --> 10:17.910
Sorry to jabber on so long.

10:17.910 --> 10:19.840
I'm sure you don't care, right?

10:19.840 --> 10:21.390
We do. Go on.

10:21.390 --> 10:23.100
<b>A sense for horror</b>

10:23.100 --> 10:27.210
But a supernatural phenomenon? I know you're
not hurt, but is that really okay?

10:27.210 --> 10:29.110
You should carry salt on you!

10:29.110 --> 10:30.230
Salt?

10:30.230 --> 10:33.630
Hey, when you can't get up in the morning, 
is it because of sleep paralysis?

10:35.590 --> 10:37.360
No, I'm just sleepy.

10:37.360 --> 10:39.110
<b>Honest</b>

10:39.110 --> 10:43.300
It's totally up to you, but is one alarm
 clock really going to be enough?

10:44.700 --> 10:46.630
I could give you a wake-up call.

10:47.370 --> 10:49.120
Hey, that's a good idea.

10:49.120 --> 10:51.730
You should still set your alarm clock,

10:51.730 --> 10:54.990
but I'll give you a call 
to make sure you get up.

10:55.640 --> 10:57.730
And you text him, Sengoku. It'll be funny.

10:57.730 --> 10:58.600
Why's that?

10:58.600 --> 11:00.940
Are you teasing me again? 
I want to call him, too!

11:00.940 --> 11:03.010
It's for Yanagi, okay?

11:03.010 --> 11:04.460
But a text...?

11:04.460 --> 11:07.200
I-I'm really not a morning person, so...

11:07.200 --> 11:09.640
You can just hang up 
without saying anything,

11:09.640 --> 11:11.380
so long as the call wakes you up.

11:11.380 --> 11:12.850
Thank you!

11:13.860 --> 11:16.040
{bg}A text... A wake-up text...

11:16.040 --> 11:17.570
This'll be fun.

11:16.040 --> 11:18.410
<i>{int}I need to make sure I wake up tomorrow.</i>

11:17.570 --> 11:18.410
Yeah.

11:21.530 --> 11:24.030
<b>Yanagi</b>

11:47.230 --> 11:49.850
What? It's morning?

11:49.850 --> 11:50.930
Can't be...

11:52.310 --> 11:55.440
It's 1:30. It's still nighttime.

11:55.890 --> 11:57.450
I'll go back to sleep.

12:05.320 --> 12:08.460
<i>{int}Hey, Akane? Good morning! Are you up?</i>

12:09.040 --> 12:09.980
I'm not getting up.

12:09.980 --> 12:10.770
<i>{int}Huh?</i>

12:13.710 --> 12:15.260
So tired...

12:21.390 --> 12:23.420
<i>{int}Oh, Yanagi? Good morning.</i>

12:23.420 --> 12:25.310
<i>{int}You'd better get up or else—</i>

12:33.550 --> 12:35.620
<i>{int}Yanagi Akane, eighteen years old...</i>

12:36.010 --> 12:38.870
<i>{int}is incredibly bad at getting out of bed.</i>

12:39.980 --> 12:42.160
Oh, a text...

12:39.980 --> 12:42.490
<b>Sengoku-kun</b>

12:44.490 --> 12:46.440
I managed to get up!

12:46.440 --> 12:47.870
Thank you all!

12:47.870 --> 12:51.470
I'm glad, but getting hung up on without 
a word definitely stung a little.

12:51.470 --> 12:52.690
I-I'm sorry.

12:52.690 --> 12:54.700
I was so tired that 
I don't really remember...

12:54.700 --> 12:55.810
Yanagi-kun.

12:56.370 --> 12:59.330
Oh, Sengoku-kun, that text was really funny.

12:59.330 --> 12:59.840
<i>{int}Funny?</i>

12:59.840 --> 13:00.980
Thank you.

13:00.300 --> 13:04.260
<b>Thought he was being serious</b>

13:00.980 --> 13:02.550
It really did the trick and woke me up.

13:02.550 --> 13:04.150
Should we call you again tomorrow?

13:04.150 --> 13:05.880
No, thanks. I'll be fine.

13:06.230 --> 13:08.300
I have to learn to stand on my own.

13:08.300 --> 13:10.590
Plus, I did hear my alarm go off.

13:10.590 --> 13:13.270
Yeah? Let me know if you change your mind.

13:13.720 --> 13:14.600
I will!

13:15.910 --> 13:21.560
<i>{int}Yanagi wouldn't realize
until the next morning...</i>

13:22.020 --> 13:24.420
<i>that his alarm clock was done for.</i>

13:25.030 --> 13:27.530
<b>Warm</b>

13:25.030 --> 13:27.530
<b>Warm</b>

13:25.030 --> 13:27.530
<b>Warm</b>

13:25.030 --> 13:27.530
<b>Warm</b>

13:25.030 --> 13:27.530
<b>Warm</b>

13:32.500 --> 13:35.490
<i>Can decide between green and oolong tea?</i>

13:35.490 --> 13:36.640
Yanagi-kun.

13:38.790 --> 13:40.670
<b>{can}Low-Calorie Sports Drink</b>

13:39.410 --> 13:40.660
Sorry.

13:40.660 --> 13:43.340
Th-That's quite all right.
 I'm fine with anything.

13:43.340 --> 13:45.530
I was just feeling a bit thirsty.

13:45.530 --> 13:48.550
This one is brand new, isn't that right?

13:48.550 --> 13:52.930
Yanagi-kun, you talk normally with 
your classmates and Yoshikawa-san,

13:52.930 --> 13:54.810
but you're so polite with the rest of us.

13:55.170 --> 13:57.190
Just habit, I suppose.

13:57.190 --> 14:02.940
I'm casual with my friends
and people I want to be friends with.

14:04.440 --> 14:05.440
Oh.

14:08.380 --> 14:11.110
I-It's not what you think! Really!

14:11.110 --> 14:15.450
I didn't mean I don't want to be
 friends with you guys!

14:15.700 --> 14:18.210
<b>The person I want to be friendlier with
doesn't even want to talk normally to me.
I'd at least like to be acknowledged as a
classmate. What if I never get to that point?
I just don't know. I can't even think straight.
I don't want to bother Yanagi-kun with
something like this, but I can't think anymore.
This is such a shock.
I don't know what to do.</b>

14:16.380 --> 14:18.210
<i>It's too late!</i>

14:21.100 --> 14:22.420
Talk about a heavy mood!

14:21.380 --> 14:25.090
<i><b>Depressed</b></i>

14:22.420 --> 14:25.110
Wait, what's got Sengoku so down?

14:25.110 --> 14:27.950
Sengoku-san, what's up? 
Is something the matter?

14:27.950 --> 14:31.090
You can tell your pal Iura! 
Y'know, get it off your chest!

14:31.090 --> 14:32.720
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon!

14:33.250 --> 14:34.470
Buzz off.

14:34.870 --> 14:36.670
Sengoku!

14:36.980 --> 14:39.190
Okay, that's on Shu for being obnoxious.

14:39.190 --> 14:40.690
I am not!

14:40.690 --> 14:42.610
Did something happen with Ayasaki?

14:43.860 --> 14:44.980
I got dumped.

14:44.980 --> 14:47.930
Shu, Ayasaki's single now!

14:47.930 --> 14:50.240
Not by Remi! By Yanagi-kun!

14:50.880 --> 14:53.050
Oh, so Yanagi dumped you.

14:53.050 --> 14:54.870
I thought you were getting along.

14:54.870 --> 14:58.620
He said he's so polite with me
because he doesn't want to be friends.

14:58.620 --> 15:00.430
Did he really...?

15:01.770 --> 15:03.820
{fb}Yanagi, want half of this?

15:03.820 --> 15:05.250
Oh, how kind of you.

15:05.250 --> 15:07.260
{fb}I can't finish it on my own.

15:07.840 --> 15:09.310
{fb}What is it?

15:09.310 --> 15:11.140
{fb}A really sweet danish.

15:11.140 --> 15:13.350
{fb}There's so much chocolate,
 it gave me heartburn.

15:13.350 --> 15:14.410
{fb}Is it good?

15:14.410 --> 15:16.630
{fb}Yeah, I really dig it.

15:18.350 --> 15:21.920
{fb}O-Oh, that's great. I'm glad.

15:22.230 --> 15:23.520
{fb}Yes.

15:26.430 --> 15:28.790
Why are you smirking
like you've won something?

15:28.790 --> 15:32.410
You're not the only one
he's super polite with.

15:32.410 --> 15:34.370
Yeah, don't let it bother you.

15:34.370 --> 15:35.860
I know, but still...

15:35.860 --> 15:40.370
<i>{int}Everyone, even Ayasaki, seems 
awfully attracted to Yanagi.</i>

15:40.370 --> 15:44.880
Okay, I'll let it go. I'll treat him 
the same way I always do.

15:46.270 --> 15:47.990
So we're just friends...

15:47.990 --> 15:50.760
<i>What'd you want to be?</i>

15:50.760 --> 15:53.260
<b>Warm</b>

15:50.760 --> 15:53.260
<b>Warm</b>

15:50.760 --> 15:53.260
<b>Warm</b>

15:50.760 --> 15:53.260
<b>Warm</b>

15:50.760 --> 15:53.260
<b>Warm</b>

15:56.630 --> 15:57.510
Oh.

15:58.400 --> 15:59.910
S-Sengoku-kun.

16:01.770 --> 16:03.400
<b>Fresh Squeezed Juice Blend</b>

16:02.150 --> 16:04.530
I-I-I'm so sorry.

16:04.530 --> 16:07.900
No, it's fine. I was having trouble deciding.

16:09.660 --> 16:10.900
<i>Oh, that doesn't look good.</i>

16:10.900 --> 16:15.740
Um, I'm sure I could drink it,
so why don't you give it to me?

16:16.510 --> 16:19.930
I'll buy you another one, 
so please drink that instead.

16:19.930 --> 16:22.380
All right. Thank you.

16:22.380 --> 16:23.160
Of course!

16:28.040 --> 16:31.550
Here. I, um... Take this.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.580
Thank you.

16:34.240 --> 16:39.680
This juice has a unique taste, so lots of 
kids in class don't like it, you know?

16:40.520 --> 16:43.560
<i>{int}Is he trying to be more casual with me?</i>

16:44.210 --> 16:44.950
Sorry.

16:44.950 --> 16:45.810
Huh?

16:45.810 --> 16:51.120
You can talk to me however
you'd like. Don't force yourself.

16:51.570 --> 16:55.820
O-O-Oh... Okay! I will!

16:59.180 --> 17:01.920
Oh, good... I, uh, I'm glad.

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>2-4-6 Tea Blend</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Oolong Tea</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Oolong Tea</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Warm</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Warm</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Warm</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Warm</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Warm</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Warm</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:04.330
<b>Warm</b>

17:04.970 --> 17:06.830
Sengoku's grossing me out.

17:07.200 --> 17:09.980
What? Is he doing something weird?

17:09.980 --> 17:12.210
Hey, you're right! Look at that grin!

17:12.210 --> 17:12.960
<i>SLAP</i>

17:13.280 --> 17:14.680
He slapped me!

17:14.680 --> 17:17.100
Sengoku's pretty straightforward 
with his feelings.

17:17.100 --> 17:19.220
He probably made up with Yanagi.

17:22.090 --> 17:24.230
Oh, hi, Yanagin!

17:24.230 --> 17:26.460
Where are you off to?

17:26.460 --> 17:28.020
I'm returning to the classroom.

17:28.020 --> 17:31.720
Not so fast! I told you to be
casual with me, didn't I?

17:32.020 --> 17:33.790
Hey, you're laughing me off!

17:33.790 --> 17:37.610
<i>{int}If only I could play it
this straight with Sengoku-kun.</i>

17:38.540 --> 17:41.490
Oh, hi, Yanagin! Where are you off to?

17:41.490 --> 17:46.200
Why are you being so stuffy? 
I told you we're friends, didn't I?

17:46.500 --> 17:49.750
<i>{int}No, Sengoku-kun's not like that!</i>

17:49.750 --> 17:51.210
Yanagin, are you gonna cry?

17:51.210 --> 17:52.630
What's wrong?

18:00.890 --> 18:03.520
I-I'm doing it, Iura-kun.

18:03.520 --> 18:06.600
Yeah, bring it on, Akane!

18:07.240 --> 18:08.600
Here goes.

18:10.290 --> 18:11.420
What are you doing?

18:11.420 --> 18:14.090
Hello, Ishikawa-kun and Sengoku-kun.

18:14.090 --> 18:16.990
Iura-kun was saying he can 
catch a blade with his hands.

18:16.990 --> 18:18.110
Is that so?

18:19.000 --> 18:22.030
I could've caught a katana if we had one.

18:22.030 --> 18:24.730
You'd make a murderer of Yanagi?

18:26.150 --> 18:27.790
You with me, Sengoku?

18:27.790 --> 18:28.870
I wonder...

18:28.870 --> 18:33.830
If I were to say I could catch a blade 
between my hands like Iura-kun...

18:33.830 --> 18:36.760
Would Yanagi do that to me, too?

18:36.760 --> 18:37.510
Huh?

18:37.510 --> 18:39.230
M-Maybe?

18:39.230 --> 18:40.760
Yanagi-kun...

18:43.060 --> 18:46.620
seems to attract cheerful people.

18:46.620 --> 18:49.020
You mean airheads? Like Yoshikawa?

18:49.020 --> 18:52.890
If air... If cheerful people are 
easier for him to get along with,

18:52.890 --> 18:54.320
I guess I don't stand a chance.

18:54.320 --> 18:56.280
Why not be a cheerful airhead, then?

18:56.280 --> 18:58.360
When I saw her the other day...

18:58.360 --> 19:00.910
Hey, you're not listening, Sengoku.

19:02.910 --> 19:04.530
<i>Hey, that's Yoshikawa-san.</i>

19:04.970 --> 19:06.040
Ow!

19:06.720 --> 19:08.160
I'm sorry!

19:08.160 --> 19:11.140
She mistook the wall
for a person and apologized?

19:11.140 --> 19:12.350
I do that sometimes, too.

19:12.350 --> 19:13.790
There's more.

19:17.070 --> 19:20.680
It's the first time I've seen 
someone glare at a wall.

19:20.680 --> 19:23.150
I don't think I can ever 
be like Yoshikawa-san.

19:23.150 --> 19:24.490
Okay, and...

19:23.150 --> 19:24.690
Me either.

19:24.690 --> 19:25.930
Take this!

19:25.930 --> 19:26.930
You caught it?!

19:26.930 --> 19:30.730
But if you acted more like Shu, 
maybe you could be friendlier.

19:31.300 --> 19:33.030
You want me to act like Iura-kun?

19:33.030 --> 19:35.070
That's compromising too much!

19:35.070 --> 19:38.070
I feel you, but he's better than Yoshikawa.

19:38.070 --> 19:40.510
I'll show you what I mean. Just watch.

19:40.510 --> 19:41.750
O-Okay.

19:42.200 --> 19:43.640
Yanagi!

19:43.640 --> 19:44.200
Yes?

19:44.200 --> 19:45.680
Side attack!

19:44.200 --> 19:48.200
Tickle

19:44.200 --> 19:48.200
Tickle

19:45.680 --> 19:48.200
Akane's ticklish on 
the soles of his feet, too!

19:48.830 --> 19:49.690
Now you do it.

19:49.690 --> 19:50.890
Me, do <i>that</i>?!

19:50.890 --> 19:52.580
No! Nope! Never! No way! No how!

19:52.580 --> 19:55.720
You idiot! You'll never 
accomplish anything like that!

19:55.720 --> 19:57.380
You want to be better friends 
than before, don't you?!

19:57.380 --> 19:59.090
You want to be better friends 
than now, don't you?!

20:00.110 --> 20:02.170
I need to practice first, Ishikawa-kun.

20:02.170 --> 20:05.090
Why do you need a rehearsal?

20:05.400 --> 20:06.200
There.

20:05.640 --> 20:07.100
<b>Grab</b>

20:07.090 --> 20:09.660
Stop! That was way too sensual!

20:10.100 --> 20:13.360
That wasn't what I was expecting. 
What's with you?

20:13.360 --> 20:14.800
I don't have any idea.

20:14.800 --> 20:16.730
Don't be mad.

20:16.730 --> 20:18.990
It was like you were molesting me.

20:18.990 --> 20:20.170
Seriously?

20:20.170 --> 20:22.740
I'm glad we're rehearsing.

20:22.740 --> 20:24.430
You're a molester, President?

20:24.430 --> 20:26.990
Why do you pass by at 
the worst possible times?!

20:27.310 --> 20:28.880
Doing a little roleplay?

20:28.880 --> 20:30.660
Yeah, and Sengoku's the molester.

20:30.660 --> 20:31.250
Hey.

20:31.250 --> 20:33.390
Then who are you, Ishikawa-kun?

20:33.390 --> 20:34.500
Yanagi.

20:34.500 --> 20:38.500
The casting's all wrong! 
Are we on a train or something?!

20:38.500 --> 20:41.450
So the scene's Akane
 getting felt up on the train, huh?

20:41.450 --> 20:43.010
Who should I be?

20:44.140 --> 20:46.900
I only wish I could be as dumb as you.

20:46.900 --> 20:48.930
He actually called someone dumb!

20:48.930 --> 20:51.270
What's this all of a sudden? Bullying?

20:51.270 --> 20:52.810
No.

20:52.810 --> 20:56.740
Sengoku-kun wants to get closer with a friend.

20:56.740 --> 20:58.750
What? We're all already good friends.

20:58.750 --> 21:00.280
Is that not enough for him?

21:00.280 --> 21:03.130
Am I the only one who thinks we're friends?!

21:03.130 --> 21:06.160
Why do you look like your life's in danger?!

21:06.160 --> 21:07.280
What's up?

21:07.640 --> 21:08.740
You fighting?

21:08.740 --> 21:10.540
<i>I can't believe your timing!</i>

21:10.540 --> 21:12.490
The president's kicking me out!

21:12.490 --> 21:14.500
What? The president's bullying someone?!

21:14.500 --> 21:15.920
That's enough!

21:17.120 --> 21:19.560
Sengoku-kun wouldn't do that.

21:20.040 --> 21:23.550
Smile

21:20.040 --> 21:23.550
Smile

21:20.040 --> 21:23.550
Smile

21:23.550 --> 21:26.610
You always take Sengoku-san's side.

21:26.610 --> 21:28.180
D-Do I?

21:28.180 --> 21:30.880
Sengoku and Yanagi really
are good friends, huh?

21:30.880 --> 21:32.810
<i>{int}Could you be any more obvious?!</i>

21:33.400 --> 21:36.680
Yanagi, Sengoku says he wants to be Shu.

21:36.680 --> 21:38.570
Huh? Why?

21:38.570 --> 21:40.630
I like him the way he is.

21:41.570 --> 21:44.790
What's this?! You want to be me?!

21:42.530 --> 21:47.320
<b>BEEEEAM</b>

21:44.790 --> 21:46.700
Let's start with a haircut!

21:45.660 --> 21:47.320
I didn't mean the way you look!

21:47.320 --> 21:50.310
First a molester, then Iura-kun...

21:50.310 --> 21:52.080
Talk about a busy day, President.

21:55.580 --> 21:56.710
Molester?

21:56.710 --> 21:58.330
No! That was a misunderstanding!

21:58.330 --> 22:00.290
Miyamura, come to the
 student council room later!

21:58.330 --> 22:04.210
<i><b>Yammer
Yammer
Yammer</b></i>

22:00.290 --> 22:02.130
Huh? Why? What did I do?

22:02.130 --> 22:03.770
I'm angry at you!

22:03.770 --> 22:04.680
Huh? Why?

22:04.680 --> 22:06.660
{bg}You should know already!

22:05.330 --> 22:08.730
Miyamura-kun and Sengoku-kun 
get along great, don't they?

22:06.660 --> 22:08.730
{bg}You just caused a lot of confusion!

23:36.600 --> 23:40.020
Next time
page.9 Teacher
